        {"zh": "你呛了一口", "en": "You swallowed water."},
        {"zh": "这一蹄带着全身的力", "en": "That kick had my whole body in it."},
        {"zh": "你想挡，挡不住水下的力", "en": "You block, but not the weight of water."},
        {"zh": "我又冲了一次", "en": "I charge again."},
        {"zh": "你的护甲在水里很沉", "en": "Your armor is heavy in water."},
        {"zh": "我撞你手上的东西", "en": "I hit what you are holding."},
        {"zh": "你别浮上去", "en": "Do not surface."}
